"/api"
Authentication
All endpoints require authentication via authenticateToken middleware. Include your authentication token in the request headers.

1. Core Recording Operations
List Recordings
httpGET /api/recordings?type={type}&isActive={boolean}&page={number}&limit={number}

Example:
GET /api/recordings?type=tts&isActive=true&page=1&limit=50

Response:
{
  "recordings": [...],
  "totalCount": 100,
  "currentPage": 1,
  "totalPages": 2
}
Get Single Recording
httpGET /api/recordings/{id}

Example:
GET /api/recordings/123

Response:
{
  "id": 123,
  "name": "Welcome Message",
  "text": "Welcome to our service",
  "type": "tts",
  "fileUrl": "/recordings/tenant_123_file.mp3",
  "asteriskStatus": "deployed",
  ...
}
Create Recording
httpPOST /api/recordings

Example Body:
{
  "name": "New Welcome Message",
  "description": "Main IVR greeting",
  "text": "Thank you for calling. Press 1 for sales.",
  "type": "tts",
  "elevenLabsVoiceId": "21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM"
}
Update Recording
httpPUT /api/recordings/{id}

Example Body:
{
  "name": "Updated Welcome Message",
  "text": "Updated greeting text",
  "isActive": true
}
Delete Recording
httpDELETE /api/recordings/{id}

Response:
{
  "message": "Recording deleted successfully",
  "deletedFromAsterisk": true,
  "deletedFile": "/recordings/file.mp3"
}

2. Audio Generation & Files
Generate Audio (Eleven Labs TTS)
httpPOST /api/recordings/{id}/generate

Response:
{
  "id": 123,
  "fileName": "tenant_1_recording_123.mp3",
  "fileUrl": "/recordings/tenant_1_recording_123.mp3",
  "fileSize": 45678,
  "generatedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "message": "Audio generated successfully"
}
Upload Audio File
httpPOST /api/recordings/{id}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

Form Data:
- audio: [audio file]

Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "File uploaded successfully",
  "recording": {
    "id": 123,
    "fileName": "uploaded_file.mp3",
    "fileSize": 98765,
    "generatedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
Download/Stream Audio
httpGET /api/recordings/{id}/audio

Returns: Audio file stream
Preview Text-to-Speech
httpPOST /api/recordings/preview

Example Body:
{
  "text": "This is a preview of the voice",
  "voiceId": "21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM"  // optional
}

Response:
{
  "audioUrl": "/api/recordings/preview/cache/{cacheKey}",
  "cacheKey": "abc123...",
  "cached": false,
  "expiresAt": "2024-01-15T11:30:00Z",
  "charactersUsed": 28
}

3. Asterisk Integration
Deploy to Asterisk
httpPOST /api/recordings/{id}/deploy-to-asterisk

Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "asteriskPath": "tenant_1_123.mp3",
  "remoteFilePath": "/var/lib/asterisk/sounds/custom/tenant_1_123.mp3",
  "deployedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "fileInfo": "SUCCESS: -rw-r--r-- 1 asterisk asterisk 45678 Jan 15 10:30...",
  "message": "Recording deployed to remote Asterisk server successfully"
}
Test SSH Connection
httpPOST /api/recordings/test-asterisk-ssh

Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "SSH connection successful",
  "host": "34.29.105.211",
  "output": "SSH connection test successful"
}
List Remote Recordings
httpGET /api/recordings/asterisk/list

Response:
{
  "recordings": [
    {
      "filename": "tenant_1_123.mp3",
      "size": "45K",
      "lastModified": "Jan 15 10:30",
      "fullPath": "/var/lib/asterisk/sounds/custom/tenant_1_123.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
Get Asterisk Playback Path
httpGET /api/recordings/{id}/asterisk-path

Response:
{
  "asteriskPath": "custom/tenant_1_123",
  "fullPath": "/var/lib/asterisk/sounds/custom/tenant_1_123.mp3",
  "deployedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "status": "deployed"
}

4. Bulk Operations
Bulk Actions
httpPOST /api/recordings/bulk/{action}

Actions: deploy-to-asterisk, generate-audio, delete

Example Body:
{
  "recordingIds": [123, 124, 125],
  "options": {
    "force": false  // for delete action
  }
}

Response:
{
  "action": "generate-audio",
  "totalRecordings": 3,
  "successful": 2,
  "failed": 1,
  "results": [...],
  "errors": [...]
}

5. Recording Templates
List Templates
httpGET /api/recording-templates?category={category}&isActive={boolean}

Response:
{
  "templates": [...],
  "totalCount": 10,
  "currentPage": 1,
  "totalPages": 1
}
Create Template
httpPOST /api/recording-templates

Example Body:
{
  "name": "Customer Greeting Template",
  "description": "Personalized greeting",
  "textTemplate": "Hello {{name}}, welcome to {{company}}. Your account number is {{accountNumber}}.",
  "variables": ["name", "company", "accountNumber"],
  "category": "greetings",
  "defaultVoiceId": "21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM"
}
Generate from Template
httpPOST /api/recording-templates/{id}/generate

Example Body:
{
  "name": "John Doe Greeting",
  "variables": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "company": "ABC Corp",
    "accountNumber": "12345"
  },
  "voiceId": "21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM"
}

