Error Responses
All endpoints may return error responses in this format:
json{
  "error": "Error message description"
}
Common HTTP status codes:

400 - Bad Request (validation errors, missing data)
401 - Unauthorized (authentication required)
403 - Forbidden (insufficient permissions)
404 - Not Found (resource doesn't exist)
500 - Internal Server Error




This should help you understand and test all the available endpoints in your recording service!RetryClaude can make mistakes. Please double-check responses.